Cell["\<\
we observe very little change in drive: in particular, there doesn\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]t seem to be an RF increase for E[N] = \[Lambda] >\
\[TildeTilde] 4, and the RF increase that exists for \[Lambda] < 4 seems \
minimal.\
\>", "Text",
