Cell["\<\
just barely. this is likely also a numerical error, since it comes at \
\[Lambda]=20, which is around where our truncated-poisson approximation \
becomes less accurate.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.995636410443767*^9, 3.995636411788083*^9}, {
  3.995645965680954*^9, 
  3.995645991317808*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"006ddd8f-782e-4c9b-8043-\
2ea77cfe6642"],

